          "instructionUz": "\"to be\" fe'lining yetishmayotgan shakllarini yozing.",
          "explanationUz": "Jadvalni to'ldirish — barcha 8 ta shaklni yodda saqlash uchun.\nEsda tuting: I → am, he/she/it → is, you/we/they → are.",
          "columns": ["FULL FORM", "SHORT FORM"],
          "items": [
            { "subject": "I", "full": "I am", "short": "I'm", "given": true },
            { "subject": "you", "full": "you are", "short": "you're", "shortBlank": true },
            { "subject": "he", "full": "he is", "short": "he's", "fullBlank": true },
            { "subject": "she", "full": "she is", "short": "she's", "shortBlank": true },
            { "subject": "it", "full": "it is", "short": "it's", "shortBlank": true },
            { "subject": "we", "full": "we are", "short": "we're", "shortBlank": true },
            { "subject": "you", "full": "you are", "short": "you're", "fullBlank": true },
            { "subject": "they", "full": "they are", "short": "they're", "shortBlank": true }
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "10",
          "type": "text_gap_fill",
          "instructionEn": "Complete the short text with the correct form of the verb \"to be\" (am/is/are).",
          "instructionUz": "Qisqa matnni \"to be\" fe'lining to'g'ri shakli bilan to'ldiring (am/is/are).",
          "explanationUz": "Bu — o'zini tanishtirish matni. Har bo'shliqda EGAga qarang:\n• I → am\n• This / Mary → is\n• Mary and I / We → are\nDIQQAT: 'Mary and I' — ikki kishi, ya'ni 'we' ga teng → ARE (is emas!).",
          "textTitle": "George haqida",
          "items": [
            { "n": 1, "textEn": "Hi, I 1) ___ George.", "answer": "am", "given": true },
            { "n": 2, "textEn": "I 2) ___ a pilot.", "answer": "am", "commonMistake": { "wrong": "an", "whyUz": "Qo'lyozmada 'an' yozilgan — bu ARTIKL, fe'l emas! Savol 'to be' fe'lini so'rayapti. 'I AM a pilot' — 'a pilot' allaqachon matnda bor." } },
            { "n": 3, "textEn": "This 3) ___ my friend, Mary.", "answer": "is" },
            { "n": 4, "textEn": "Mary and I 4) ___ neighbours.", "answer": "are", "commonMistake": { "wrong": "is", "whyUz": "Qo'lyozmada 'is' — XATO. 'Mary and I' = IKKI kishi = 'we' → ARE. Ega qo'shma bo'lsa, doim ko'plik." } },
            { "n": 5, "textEn": "We 5) ___ also good friends.", "answer": "are" },
            { "n": 6, "textEn": "I 6) ___ thirty-three years old", "answer": "am" },
            { "n": 7, "textEn": "and Mary 7) ___ twenty-seven.", "answer": "is" },
            { "n": 8, "textEn": "We 8) ___ from Edinburgh, Scotland.", "answer": "are" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "grammar_exercise",
      "title": "Personal pronouns",
